            {
              "cardId": "c_1009_uni1",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Agony is Tressa's main mechanic\nAgony is a debuff applied to enemies\nAt the end of the turn enemies take 50% Fixed Damage for each Agony Stack\nAfterwards Agony decreases in half\nMax Agony Stacks is 20\nFixed Damage is unaffected by any buffs or debuffs\nThis mechanic is gutted at 20 max stacks"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "WHY, WHY DID THEY HAVE TO MAKE AGONY CAP AT 20\nITS SO BAD, MY GIRL, WHAT HAVE THEY DONE TO YOU"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
